{
  "$comment": "Synthetic Google Play Developer API answers for push.py pull google's tests (the invented Sample Recipes app; the edit, ids and URLs are made up). Pictures at play-lh.googleusercontent.com are drawn by the test at the size their URL names; the two tablet types serve the same picture. Each image's sha256 is the test's own drawing's, so the downloads are the originals.",
